General_SiSo_Auto_Cell_Timing_Offset_Modification_With_L3Call
    [Documentation]
    ...  The purpose of this test case is to check after cell timing offset parameters modification if
    ...  status of cells is "online", BTS is in OnAir state and L3 call is possible.
    ...  The test is only valid for CPRI and eCPRI rmods. The test supports only not shared cell.
    ...
    ...  Main test steps:
    ...    1) getting initial values of cell timing offset parameters
    ...    2) setting cell timing offset parameters to new values:
    ...         - actCellTimingOffsetCpriN=false
    ...         - sfnOffset=0
    ...         - frameStartOffset=0
    ...    3) checking BTS and cells statuses
    ...    4) executing L3 call
    ...    5) repeating steps 2-4 for new values of cell timing offset parameters:
    ...       parameter set 2:
    ...         - actCellTimingOffsetCpriN=true
    ...         - sfnOffset=0
    ...         - frameStartOffset=0
    ...       parameter set 3:
    ...         - actCellTimingOffsetCpriN=true
    ...         - sfnOffset=1234
    ...         - frameStartOffset=1234
    ...       parameter set 4:
    ...         - actCellTimingOffsetCpriN=false
    ...         - sfnOffset=1234
    ...         - frameStartOffset=1234
    ...    6) restoring initial values of cell timing offset parameters
    ...
    ...    ARGS:
    ...      - cell_id (int): global cell id of NR/LTE cell which will be used in TC, e.g.: 1
    ...      - throughputs (dict): dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell; defaults to None.
    ...        Example:
    ...                 {'827736065': {'throughput': {'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                               'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'},
    ...                                'deviation': '90%'},
    ...                  }
    ...      - cell_type (str): type of cell, nr/lte; defaults to 'nr'.
    ...      - protocol (str): data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...      - udp_buffer (str): monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...      - tput_verification_via_btslog (bool): True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                             False - throuput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False.
    ...      - ue_network_modes: dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"}
    ...                          possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                          when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                          with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...                          mandatory for SA+NSA setups, defaults to None
    [Arguments]                                         ${cell_id}
    ...                                                 ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...                                                 ${cell_type}=nr
    ...                                                 ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                                 ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                                 ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${False}
    ...                                                 ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ${bts_type}=                                        hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    Create admin session with default alias             bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${connection}=                                      connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${initial_parameters}=                              Set Variable        ${None}

    ${cell_dist_names}                                  admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ...                                                 cell_type=${cell_type}
    ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
    @{cells_distnames_for_call}=                        Create List
    ...                                                 ${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ${is_cell_shared}=                                  admin_info_model.is_cell_shared
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                 cell_type=${cell_type}
    Should Be Equal            ${is_cell_shared}        ${False}
    ...                                                 msg=This test case supports only not shared cells. Cell with id ${cell_id} is shared.

    ${rmods_protocols}=                                 admin_info_model.get_rmods_protocols
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ${rmod_id}=                                         admin_info_model.get_rmod_ids_for_cell_id
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                 cell_type=${cell_type}
    ${rmod_id}=                                         admin_info_model.translate_rmod_index_from_runtime
    ...                                                 runtime_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ${rmod_protocol}=                                   Set Variable
    ...                                                 ${rmods_protocols["${rmod_id}"]}

    ${initial_parameters}=                              Get Initial Cell Timing Offset Parameters Values
    ...                                                 cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                 rmod_protocol=${rmod_protocol}

    ${steps_parameters}=                                Prepare Parameters Values For Each Step

    FOR    ${step_parameters}    IN      @{steps_parameters}
        Set Cell Timing Offset Parameters Values        cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
        ...                                             actCellTimingOffset=${step_parameters["actCellTimingOffset"]}
        ...                                             sfnOffset=${step_parameters["sfnOffset"]}
        ...                                             frameStartOffset=${step_parameters["frameStartOffset"]}
        ...                                             connection=${connection}
        ...                                             bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...                                             rmod_protocol=${rmod_protocol}

        Sleep                                           10s
        ...                                             reason=Waiting 10s before checking BTS and cells statuses...

        Verify Statuses Of Cells And BTS                bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...                                             connection=${connection}

        Execute L3 call                                 throughputs=${throughputs}
        ...                                             protocol=${protocol}
        ...                                             udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
        ...                                             cells_distnames=${cells_distnames_for_call}
        ...                                             tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
        ...                                             ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    END

    [Teardown]                                          Run Keywords
    ...                                                 Robot Log Operation
    ...                                                 Auto cell timing offset modification test teardown...
    ...                                                 AND
    ...                                                 Run Keyword If      ${initial_parameters}
    ...                                                 Cell Timing Offset Modification Test Teardown
    ...                                                 cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                 initial_parameters=${initial_parameters}
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                 rmod_protocol=${rmod_protocol}


Prepare Parameters Values For Each Step
    &{step_1_parameters}=                               Create Dictionary
    ...                                                 actCellTimingOffset=false
    ...                                                 sfnOffset=0
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset=0
    &{step_2_parameters}=                               Create Dictionary
    ...                                                 actCellTimingOffset=true
    ...                                                 sfnOffset=0
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset=0
    &{step_3_parameters}=                               Create Dictionary
    ...                                                 actCellTimingOffset=true
    ...                                                 sfnOffset=1234
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset=12340000
    &{step_4_parameters}=                               Create Dictionary
    ...                                                 actCellTimingOffset=false
    ...                                                 sfnOffset=1234
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset=12340000

    @{steps_parameters}=                                Create List
    ...                                                 ${step_1_parameters}
    ...                                                 ${step_2_parameters}
    ...                                                 ${step_3_parameters}
    ...                                                 ${step_4_parameters}
    [Return]                                            @{steps_parameters}


Get Initial Cell Timing Offset Parameters Values
    [Documentation]
    ...  Gets initial values of cell timing offset parameters for CB008004
    [Arguments]                                         ${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 ${rmod_protocol}
    Robot Log Operation                                 Getting initial values of cell timing offset parameters...

    IF    '${rmod_protocol}'=='CPRI'
        ${actCellTimingOffset}=                         Get Value Of Parameter If Exists
        ...                                             dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
        ...                                             param_name=actCellTimingOffsetCpriN
    ELSE
        ${actCellTimingOffset}=                         Get Value Of Parameter If Exists
        ...                                             dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
        ...                                             param_name=actCellTimingOffset
    END

    ${sfnOffset}=                                       Get Value Of Parameter If Exists
    ...                                                 dist_name=${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 param_name=sfnOffset

    ${frameStartOffset}=                                Get Value Of Parameter If Exists
    ...                                                 dist_name=${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 param_name=frameStartOffset

    &{initial_parameters}=                              Create Dictionary
    ...                                                 actCellTimingOffset=${actCellTimingOffset}
    ...                                                 sfnOffset=${sfnOffset}
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset=${frameStartOffset}

    Robot Log Result                                    Initial values of cell timing offset parameters: ${initial_parameters}
    ...                                                 to_console=${True}

    [Return]                                            ${initial_parameters}


Set Cell Timing Offset Parameters Values
    [Documentation]
    ...  Sets cell timing offset parameters for CB008004
    [Arguments]                                         ${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 ${actCellTimingOffset}
    ...                                                 ${sfnOffset}
    ...                                                 ${frameStartOffset}
    ...                                                 ${connection}
    ...                                                 ${bts_type}
    ...                                                 ${rmod_protocol}
    Robot Log Operation                                 Setting cell timing offset parameters...
    config_operations.connect                           alias=${connection}
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    IF    '${rmod_protocol}'=='CPRI'
        ${actCellTiming}=                               Set Variable
        ...                                             actCellTimingOffsetCpriN
    ELSE
        ${actCellTiming}=                               Set Variable
        ...                                             actCellTimingOffset
    END

    &{parameters_values}=                               Create Dictionary
    ...                                                 ${actCellTiming}=${actCellTimingOffset}
    ...                                                 sfnOffset=${sfnOffset}
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset=${frameStartOffset}
    config_operations.set_parameter_value               dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
    ...                                                 param_name=${actCellTiming}
    ...                                                 param_value=${actCellTimingOffset}

    config_operations.set_parameters_values             dist_name=${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 sfnOffset=${sfnOffset}
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset=${frameStartOffset}

    ${calculated_frameStartOffset_value}=               Convert To Integer
    ...                                                 ${parameters_values["frameStartOffset"]}
    ${calculated_frameStartOffset_value}=               Evaluate
    ...                                                 ${parameters_values["frameStartOffset"]}/10000
    ${calculated_frameStartOffset_value}=               Convert To Integer
    ...                                                 ${calculated_frameStartOffset_value}
    Set To Dictionary                                   ${parameters_values}
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset
    ...                                                 ${calculated_frameStartOffset_value}

    Robot Log Result                                    New values of cell timing offset parameters: ${parameters_values}
    ...                                                 to_console=${True}


Verify Statuses Of Cells And BTS
    [Documentation]
    ...  Verifies if status of cells is "online" and if BTS is in OnAir state.
    [Arguments]                                         ${bts_type}
    ...                                                 ${connection}
    Robot Log Operation                                 Verifying cells online statuses...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer             10s
    ...                                                 5s
    ...                                                 Check statuses of all cells
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ...                                                 status_variant=online

    Robot Log Operation                                 Verifying BTS OnAir state...
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer             10s
    ...                                                 5s
    ...                                                 Verify BTS states
    ...                                                 status=OnAir
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}


Cell Timing Offset Modification Test Teardown
    [Documentation]
    ...  Teardown for cell timing offset modification test
    [Arguments]                                         ${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 ${initial_parameters}
    ...                                                 ${connection}
    ...                                                 ${bts_type}
    ...                                                 ${rmod_protocol}

    config_operations.connect                           alias=${connection}
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    IF    '${rmod_protocol}'=='CPRI'
        ${actCellTiming}=                               Set Variable
        ...                                             actCellTimingOffsetCpriN
    ELSE
        ${actCellTiming}=                               Set Variable
        ...                                             actCellTimingOffset
    END

    IF    '${initial_parameters["actCellTimingOffset"]}'!='${None}'
        config_operations.set_parameter_value
        ...                                             dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
        ...                                             param_name=${actCellTiming}
        ...                                             param_value=${initial_parameters["actCellTimingOffset"]}
    ELSE
        config_operations.delete_parameter
        ...                                             dist_name=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1
        ...                                             param_name=${actCellTiming}
    END

    Run Keyword If                                      '${initial_parameters["sfnOffset"]}'!='${None}'
    ...                                                 config_operations.set_parameters_values
    ...                                                 dist_name=${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 sfnOffset=${initial_parameters["sfnOffset"]}
    ...                                                 frameStartOffset=${initial_parameters["frameStartOffset"]}
    ...                                                 ELSE
    ...                                                 Run Keywords
    ...                                                 config_operations.delete_parameter
    ...                                                 dist_name=${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 param_name=sfnOffset
    ...                                                 skip_validation=${True}
    ...                                                 AND
    ...                                                 config_operations.delete_parameter
    ...                                                 dist_name=${cell_dist_name}
    ...                                                 param_name=frameStartOffset

    Robot Log Result                                    Cell timing offset parameters have been successfully set to initial values.
    ...                                                 to_console=${True}
